#var, use command >Rest Client: Switch Environment in search bar of vs code
@id =1

###

### Get all academic-periods
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/academic-periods HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get academic-period by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/academic-periods/{{id}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Create a new academic-period
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/academic-periods HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "2025-1",
  "description": "Primer semestre del año académico 2025",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "name": "Semestre 2025-1",
  "startDate": "2025-02-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "endDate": "2025-06-30T23:59:59.999Z"
}

###

### Update an existing academic-period
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/academic-periods/{{id}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "description": "Primer semestre del año académico 2025 (fechas extendidas)",
  "name": "Semestre 2025-1",
  "startDate": "2025-02-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "endDate": "2025-07-15T23:59:59.999Z"
}
###

### Delete a academic-period
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/academic-periods/{{id}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
